BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Visiting the Brightmoor office) Tj T* () Tj T* (Visitors are welcome at the Brightmoor office from 08:30 to 17:30, Monday to) Tj T* (Friday. Every visitor must be registered at the front desk by the member of) Tj T* (staff they are meeting. The front desk is on the ground floor, to the left of) Tj T* (the main entrance. Visitors who arrive without a booking may wait in the lobby) Tj T* (for up to 15 minutes while a host is found.) Tj ET
