BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Getting there) Tj T* () Tj T* (The nearest railway station is Brightmoor Central, a 12 minute walk from the) Tj T* (office. Trains from the airport take 35 minutes. The visitor car park has 24) Tj T* (spaces and costs 4 euros for the whole day; it must be booked one day in) Tj T* (advance. Bicycle racks are free and are next to the east entrance.) Tj ET
